<title>MEXICO: Mexico soybean oil import data updated - ASA, USB.</title>
<headline>Mexico soybean oil import data updated - ASA, USB.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The local offices of</p>
<p>United Soybean Board (USB) and American Soybean Association</p>
<p>(ASA) updated Friday data for the top importers of soybean</p>
<p>oil.</p>
<p>Data is for the marketing year Oct 1995-September 1996,</p>
<p>updated from figures given Feb 24. Weight in tonnes.</p>
<p>    Importer		    Tonnage	     Pct Total</p>
<p>    Aceites El Zapote	 22,295		  39.22</p>
<p>    Industrial Patrona	19,499		  34.30</p>
<p>    Hidrogenadora Nacional   8,091		  14.23</p>
<p>    Procesadora de Carne     2,234		   3.39</p>
<p>    Sub Total		   52,119		  91.70</p>
<p>    Others			 4,720		   8.30</p>
<p>    Total			 56,838		 100.00</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
</text>
